{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0032_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0032_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c25463e0be9082916581b6866fc05d8a2ab2686551857f024962667ff0a073a8", "ja": "これは、見ちゃダメなやつだから！　\n絶対絶対、放送とかしちゃダメだからなー……！！", "zh": "这影片绝对不能让人看到！\n绝对绝对，不可以播出去啦……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
